message: "If you use CEREBRO in your research, please cite this software."
title: "CEREBRO"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Barreto"
    given-names: "Gabriel Henrique Castanho"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1613-9416"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gabsbarreto/CEREBRO"
url: "https://github.com/gabsbarreto/CEREBRO"
abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted research application for extracting structured information
  from scientific PDFs, spreadsheets, and text records using configurable
  local and API-based OCR and language-model workflows.
keywords:
  - "systematic reviews"
  - "evidence synthesis"
  - "data extraction"
  - "document processing"
  - "artificial intelligence"
